      50.88,
      404.71,
      286.72,
      637.28
    ],
    "text": "My No.: WEDS/LND/9/ACQ/2-3. Ministry File No.: 4-3/4/2014/133. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No: 28 of 1964, that the Government intend to acquire the following land/ servitude which is required for a public purpose:- Description of land servitude to be acquired: The allotments of land in extent about 0.7081 He. depicted in Sheet No. 8 Plan Zonal 02 from Zonal 02 in C. M. No. 620142 prepared by Surveyor General, situated at Gangodagama Village, 219B, Gangodagama Grama Niladhari Division, Weligepola Divisional Secretariat Rathnapura District and Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
