    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      410.96,
      542.25,
      611.36
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/ lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Weligepola Divisional Secretariat on the 19th day of July, 2017 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 12th day of July, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/ servitude, the amount of compensation of such amount. H. M. H. .BANDARA, Divisional Secretary, Weligepola. Weligepola Divisional Secretariat, 14th June, 2017.",
